{
    "id": "14",
    "title": "測試套件",
    "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12) 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10B981\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"m22 4-11.09 11.09L7 11\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">**測試套件 (Testing Suite)** 是 Photon 的驗證骨幹。基於 **Bun Test 核心**，它透過從回饋循環中移除 TCP 網路堆疊，在毫秒內執行您的整個整合矩陣。</p></div><h2>驗證引擎</h2><p>在 Photon 中進行測試並非模擬 HTTP 請求；而是直接在記憶體中執行「請求-回應」生命週期。這種方法在保持單元測試等級效能的同時，提供了與正式環境行為 100% 一致的保真度。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">零_IO_測試</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">繞過物理網路層。請求透過記憶體緩衝區直接派發到路由核心。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">流暢斷言</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">針對狀態碼、JSON 結構和資料庫狀態的可讀、可鏈式斷言。為表達力而生。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20\"/><path d=\"M20 12H4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">隔離啟動</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">為每個測試快速啟動核心實例。並行測試執行 worker 之間不會有狀態洩漏。</p></div></div><h2>測試獨立的 Photon 應用</h2><p>直接測試 Photon 處理器，無需啟動 TCP 伺服器。非常適合微服務與小型邏輯單元。</p><pre><code>import { test, expect } from 'bun:test'\nimport { Photon } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\napp.get('/ping', (c) => c.text('pong'))\n\ntest('ping 路由返回 pong', async () => {\n  const res = await app.fetch(new Request('http://localhost/ping'))\n  expect(res.status).toBe(200)\n  expect(await res.text()).toBe('pong')\n})</code></pre><h2>與 PlanetCore 一起測試</h2><p>使用 <code>createHttpTester</code> 為全棧整合測試提供極致流暢的介面。</p><pre><code>import { describe, it, beforeEach } from 'bun:test'\nimport { PlanetCore, createHttpTester } from '@gravito/core'\n\ndescribe('使用者 API', () => {\n  let tester: any\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    const core = await PlanetCore.boot({ /* 配置 */ })\n    tester = createHttpTester(core)\n  })\n\n  it('可以列出使用者', async () => {\n    const response = await tester.get('/api/users')\n    await response.assertOk().assertJson({ users: [] })\n  })\n})</code></pre><h3>支援的 HTTP 方法</h3><p>測試器透過高級 API 模擬人類互動：</p><pre><code>await tester.get('/api/users')\nawait tester.post('/api/users', { name: 'Carl' }) // 自動 JSON 序列化\nawait tester.put('/api/users/1', { name: 'Updated' })\nawait tester.delete('/api/users/1')\nawait tester.get('/api/users', { 'Authorization': 'Bearer token' })</code></pre><h2>流暢斷言矩陣</h2><p><code>TestResponse</code> 物件暴露了廣泛的語義化斷言，使您的測試代碼保持精簡且易讀。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 32px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #10B981; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase;\">狀態檢查 (Status Checks)</h4><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><code>.assertOk()</code> (200)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><code>.assertCreated()</code> (201)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><code>.assertNotFound()</code> (404)</li><li><code>.assertForbidden()</code> (403)</li></ul></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #10B981; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase;\">內容驗證 (Content Verification)</h4><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><code>.assertSee('text')</code></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><code>.assertJson({ id: 1 })</code></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><code>.assertJsonStructure({ data: [] })</code></li><li><code>.assertHeader('key', 'val')</code></li></ul></div></div><h2>資料庫與狀態測試</h2><p>在測試之間使用 Atlas 遷移重置世界，並利用工廠 (Factories) 進行可預測的資料播種。</p><pre><code>beforeEach(async () => {\n  await DB.migrate('fresh')\n})\n\nit('透過工廠播種資料', async () => {\n  const user = await UserFactory.new().create()\n  expect(user.id).toBeDefined()\n})</code></pre><h2>Mocking 與服務替換</h2><p>利用 IoC 容器將真實服務替換為模擬物件 (Mocks)，確保您的測試不會產生意外的副作用。</p><pre><code>it('模擬郵件發送', async () => {\n  const mockMail = { send: mock(() => Promise.resolve()) }\n  core.container.instance('mail', mockMail)\n\n  const res = await tester.post('/register', { email: 't@dev.io' })\n  await res.assertOk()\n  expect(mockMail.send).toHaveBeenCalled()\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #10B981; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 規格：記憶體內派發協定 (IN_MEMORY_DISPATCH_PROTOCOL)</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Photon 的測試層不會開啟端口。它直接在適配器邊界處模擬 `Request` 和 `Response` fetch 物件，這意味著您的測試比基於傳統 `supertest` 或 `axios` 的設置快 50 倍。</p></div><h2>效能：回饋週期</h2><p>比較 1,000 個整合測試的測試套件執行時間。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_測試套件</span> <span>總計 ~0.8s</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #10B981; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(16,185,129,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>傳統_JEST_AXIOS</span> <span>總計 ~42.0s</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**架構師洞察：** 緩慢的測試是生產力的殺手。我們將測試套件構建得像引擎本身一樣「隱形」。透過保持所有內容都在記憶體中並利用 Bun 的原生並行性，我們將測試轉變為即時驗證流。</p></div>",
